# Only recovery scaffolding is ignored here: weights that regenerate for free and that nobody
# reads back. A hyperparameter sweep writes roughly 7MB of these per run, so they compound —
# unlike the figures, curves, event files and tickets, which are read, reviewed and submitted.
logs/**/*.zip
models/checkpoints/
